00:49:41.000 --> 00:50:17.000
Adam, thank you so much for joining me today on Hidden Brain. Thanks so much for having me, Shankar. After the break, your questions answered. Researcher George Bonanno responds to listener questions and comments about his work on trauma. We'll discuss his surprising and hopeful findings about how we cope with the worst that life can throw at us. You won't want to miss it. You're listening to Hidden Brain. I'm Shankar Vedantam.

