00:51:26.000 --> 00:51:57.000
titled The Trauma Script and How to Be More Resilient. Today, in our popular listener segment, Your Questions Answered, we've invited George back to answer your questions about trauma and resilience. George Bonano, welcome back to Hidden Brain. Thank you, Shankar. Nice to talk with you again. George, I want to start with a note from a listener named Janet. Like a number of others, she experienced a major and abrupt loss. her father died by suicide when she was five.

