01:12:13.000 --> 01:12:44.000
understand it. But it's very hard to understand something like that. It's very hard to study it because you need to follow people over time. It is a fact that people find themselves in situations of repeated, very difficult and traumatic circumstances. chronic abuse is a prime example, you know, repeated exposure to life-threatening events. Poverty and violence, when poverty and violence come together, you have the same situation. People can become inured to it.

120
01:12:44.000 --> 01:13:29.000
