148
01:30:55.000 --> 01:31:31.000
confused about what actually happened, and maybe I should be grieving or maybe I should be feeling more trauma symptoms, or maybe I am traumatized and I don't know it. So it very much depends. A listener named Mariah reached out to share how she dealt with two losses in rapid succession. first the loss of her brother in 2018 to a fentanyl overdose, and then the following year the loss of her infant son, Liam. Here's Mariah. So after Liam died, I told myself that I would take two weeks to just lie in a dark room, do nothing, be nothing, just grieve.

