01:32:12.000 --> 01:32:34.000
where people basically like treated me normal and it was a huge, it was a huge relief. So all of that is to say that I really, I don't view resilience as like a character trait. I don't think of it as a quality that some people have and some people don't have in my experience. It really is like a practice.

